  "title": "SIP5.11: Multi-Chain Fleet Token Transferability Enablement",
  "description": "# SIP5.11: Multi-Chain Fleet Token Transferability Enablement\n\n## Summary\nThis proposal enables token transferability for all active fleet commanders across all active chains in the Lazy Summer Protocol ecosystem.\n\n## Motivation\nFleet commanders currently have token transfers disabled by default. This proposal enables token transferability to allow for proper token movement and liquidity management across the protocol.\n\n## Specifications\n\n### Actions\n\n#### base:\n- Enable token transferability for fleet commander 0x98C49e13bf99D7CAd8069faa2A370933EC9EcF17\n- Enable token transferability for fleet commander 0x64Db8f51f1bf7064BB5A361a7265F602d348E0f0\n- Enable token transferability for fleet commander 0x2bb9ad69FEBA5547b7cD57aAfe8457D40bF834af\n\n#### arbitrum:\n- Enable token transferability for fleet commander 0x98C49e13bf99D7CAd8069faa2A370933EC9EcF17\n- Enable token transferability for fleet commander 0x4F63cfEa7458221CB3a0EEE2F31F7424Ad34bb58\n\n#### mainnet:\n- Enable token transferability for fleet commander 0x98C49e13bf99D7CAd8069faa2A370933EC9EcF17\n- Enable token transferability for fleet commander 0x17Ee2D03e88b55E762c66C76ec99C3A28A54AD8d\n- Enable token transferability for fleet commander 0x67e536797570b3d8919Df052484273815A0aB506\n- Enable token transferability for fleet commander 0x2E6abcbCCeD9Af05bc3B8a4908e0c98c29A88e10\n- Enable token transferability for fleet commander 0xE9cDA459bED6dcfb8AC61CD8cE08E2D52370cB06\n\n#### sonic:\n- Enable token transferability for fleet commander 0x507A2D9E87DBD3076e65992049C41270b47964f8\n\n## Technical Details\nThe proposal calls `setFleetTokenTransferability()` on each active fleet commander contract across all chains. This function enables token transfers for the respective fleet's token contract.\n\n## Fleet Commanders Found:\n\n### base (3 fleet commanders):\n- 0x98C49e13bf99D7CAd8069faa2A370933EC9EcF17\n- 0x64Db8f51f1bf7064BB5A361a7265F602d348E0f0\n- 0x2bb9ad69FEBA5547b7cD57aAfe8457D40bF834af\n\n### arbitrum (2 fleet commanders):\n- 0x98C49e13bf99D7CAd8069faa2A370933EC9EcF17\n- 0x4F63cfEa7458221CB3a0EEE2F31F7424Ad34bb58\n\n### mainnet (5 fleet commanders):\n- 0x98C49e13bf99D7CAd8069faa2A370933EC9EcF17\n- 0x17Ee2D03e88b55E762c66C76ec99C3A28A54AD8d\n- 0x67e536797570b3d8919Df052484273815A0aB506\n- 0x2E6abcbCCeD9Af05bc3B8a4908e0c98c29A88e10\n- 0xE9cDA459bED6dcfb8AC61CD8cE08E2D52370cB06\n\n### sonic (1 fleet commanders):\n- 0x507A2D9E87DBD3076e65992049C41270b47964f8",
